{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":60,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["锡安将来的荣耀"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["起来，发光吧！因为你的光已经来到，",{"text":"耶和华的荣耀光照你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，黑暗遮盖大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幽暗笼罩万民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和华必光照你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的荣耀必显在你身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国要来就你的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王要来就你的曙光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“举目四望吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众人正聚到你面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的儿子们从远方来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的女儿们被护送回来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你看见后就容光焕发，心花怒放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为海上的货物要归给你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国的财富都要归给你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"米甸和以法的骆驼必成群结队而来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"布满你的地面；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"示巴人都必带着黄金和乳香来颂赞耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基达的羊群必聚集到你那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼拜约的公羊必供你使用，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们在我的坛上必蒙悦纳。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我荣美的殿更荣美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“这些好像云彩飞来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像鸽子飞回巢穴的是谁？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众海岛都等候我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他施的船只领航，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从远处把你的儿子和他们的金银一同带来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以尊崇你的上帝耶和华——以色列的圣者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂已经使你得到荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“外族人要为你建造城墙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的君王要服侍你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾发怒击打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今我要施恩怜悯你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的城门要一直敞开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"昼夜不关，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好让列国的君王带着百姓和财物前来向你朝贡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不事奉你的邦国都必灭亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被彻底摧毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"黎巴嫩引以为荣的松树、杉树和黄杨树都要运到你这里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用来装饰我的圣所；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我脚踏之处充满荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欺压你之人的子孙要来向你下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐视你的人要在你脚前跪拜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要称你为耶和华的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列圣者的锡安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“虽然你曾被撇弃、被厌恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人从你那里经过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我要使你永远尊贵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世世代代都充满欢乐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必吸各国的乳汁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃列王的奶水。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，你就知道我耶和华是你的救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的大能者是你的救赎主。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"“我要带给你金子，而非铜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带给你银子，而非铁；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带给你铜，而非木头；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带给你铁，而非石头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使和平做你的官长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使公义做你的首领。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你国中再没有暴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内再没有破坏和毁灭的事；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必给你的城墙取名叫‘拯救’，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"给你的城门取名叫‘赞美’。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“太阳不再作你白昼的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"月亮也不再给你光辉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华要作你永远的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的上帝要成为你的荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的太阳不再落下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的月亮也不再消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华要作你永远的光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你悲哀的日子将要结束。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的人民都必成为义人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远拥有这土地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们是我栽种的树苗，是我手中的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以彰显我的荣耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最小的家族要变成千人大族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最弱的一国要成为强国。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"时候一到，我耶和华必迅速成就这些事。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/60.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/61.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/59.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}